389 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (All of my findings are really cool! I have had the opportunity to present at a conference at MIT. Additionally, I went to Washington D.C. in January and presented at another conference. Lastly, I am going to finals week for the Regeneron Science Talent research, which is a competition where I get to meet some other really cool people. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
