393 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (It's fun! For math research, always start with learning. Learn as much math as you like; learn the math that you are interested in. It slowly turns into research.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
