/P 1083 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
402 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 304 0 R
/T ( What has been your favorite part of the research process?)
/E ( What has been your favorite part of the research process?)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1084 0 R
/E (My favorite part of the research process is when I am having trouble with the crystallization process and collecting good movies, yet after recrystallization I can collect a really good movie. Seeing the electrons at high resolution/low angstrom makes me really excited.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 304 0 R
/T ( A memorable moment \(challenge, breakthrough, or unexpected discovery\).)
/E ( A memorable moment \(challenge, breakthrough, or unexpected discovery\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1085 0 R
/E (One memorable moment was when I presented at the national meeting for the American Chemical Society \(ACS\) in Washington DC. I was able to discuss with professors, undergraduates and graduates in the same field as me. This experience was transformative as I got to see how my work was impactful and important in the wider chemistry field.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
