/E (My first research project started in July of 2024 at UCLA. From that internship, I was able to get my research published in the Journal of the American Chemical Society, and present at the ACS national meeting. My second research project started June of 2025 at Caltech and it is currently ongoing. My future research will start in June of 2026 at the University of Groningen. )
/Pg 19 0 R
