416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1090 0 R
/E (Over the summer I would get to Caltech at 8:30 AM and start by running the high performance liquid chromatography \(HPLC\) instrument, then I worked on the TEM or on crystallization. After collecting on the TEM I would go to lunch with the other high school students at Brown Cafeteria at 1 PM \(sushi and dp strawberry\). At 1:45 PM I will continue researching. In the afternoon, I would often have more free time to do other work or relax. I would finish up my work and go home anywhere between 6PM and 9 PM.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
