446 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 307 0 R
/T (I hope to display that AI, while it may seem scary or completely negative, there can be positive outcomes to using it. I have been interested in the ways AI could be used in education for a while because education has always been an integral part of my life. However, while I have been blessed with a quality education, I understand that many people do not have the same privilege that I do. For some individuals, it is difficult to access quality tutoring because of the high cost and the shortage of quality tutors. Therefore, I see peer-tutoring as a potential outlet to provide quality tutoring without the high price involved. Through AI, I believe there is a possibility to minimize the education gap by maintaining the humanity in tutoring while enhancing the expertise of the tutors. Consequently, I hope to show that AI-assisted peer-tutoring could be a way to continue to have human connection while having a more beneficial tutoring experience.)
/E (I hope to display that AI, while it may seem scary or completely negative, there can be positive outcomes to using it. I have been interested in the ways AI could be used in education for a while because education has always been an integral part of my life. However, while I have been blessed with a quality education, I understand that many people do not have the same privilege that I do. For some individuals, it is difficult to access quality tutoring because of the high cost and the shortage of quality tutors. Therefore, I see peer-tutoring as a potential outlet to provide quality tutoring without the high price involved. Through AI, I believe there is a possibility to minimize the education gap by maintaining the humanity in tutoring while enhancing the expertise of the tutors. Consequently, I hope to show that AI-assisted peer-tutoring could be a way to continue to have human connection while having a more beneficial tutoring experience.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
