448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 307 0 R
/T (My favorite part of my research process was finalizing my research idea and finding a question that has never been researched before. I knew the main idea of what I wanted to study early on, right when I found out I was accepted into honors research which was at the end of last year. Then at the beginning of this year, I finalized exactly what I wanted to research, finding something that no one has investigated before. While I saw that individuals such as a researcher from Stanford had studied the tutors' perspective on AI-assisted tutoring, there was minimal insight from tutees. )
/E (My favorite part of my research process was finalizing my research idea and finding a question that has never been researched before. I knew the main idea of what I wanted to study early on, right when I found out I was accepted into honors research which was at the end of last year. Then at the beginning of this year, I finalized exactly what I wanted to research, finding something that no one has investigated before. While I saw that individuals such as a researcher from Stanford had studied the tutors' perspective on AI-assisted tutoring, there was minimal insight from tutees. )
/Pg 21 0 R
