461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1095 0 R
/E (I am currently brainstorming a title, but my research paper is about the many characters of the Slovak Uprising of 1944, from a grand scale to the individual. My long-term goal is to translate my findings into a spec script for a television show \(likened to Band of Brothers\) with the goal of maintaining as much factual accuracy as possible. This goal might be started next year in Capstone, or college if I choose to keep going on my research next year. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 309 0 R
/T ( What inspired you to pursue this topic?)
/E ( What inspired you to pursue this topic?)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1096 0 R
/E (For all my life, I have mourned the fact that I did not have any stories about my family as most evidence of their existence was destroyed in the Nazi strategy to erase Jewish stories and people. I was able to connect with an uncle, the namesake of the man involved in WWII and the Slovak Uprising of 1944. Rafael "Rafi" Reiss volunteered to serve the British and partisans to help defeat the Nazis and trained as a spy, diplomat, footsoldier, and parachutist. I am using the survivor Haim Hermesh's memoir "Operation Amsterdam" \(translated into English by my great-uncle Raphael Reisz\) to decipher the motives and events of the Uprising.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
