1611 0 obj
<<
/Title (I hope to display that AI, while it may seem scary or completely negative, there can be positive outcomes to using it. I have been interested in the ways AI could be used in education for a while because education has always been an integral part of my life. However, while I have been blessed with a quality education, I understand that many people do not have the same privilege that I do. For some individuals, it is difficult to access quality tutoring because of the high cost and the shortage of quality tutors. Therefore, I see peer-tutoring as a potential outlet to provide quality tutoring without the high price involved. Through AI, I believe there is a possibility to minimize the education gap by maintaining the humanity in tutoring while enhancing the expertise of the tutors. Consequently, I hope to show that AI-assisted peer-tutoring could be a way to continue to have human connection while having a more beneficial tutoring experience.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1603 0 R
>>
endobj
1612 0 obj
<<
/Title (My favorite part of my research process was finalizing my research idea and finding a question that has never been researched before. I knew the main idea of what I wanted to study early on, right when I found out I was accepted into honors research which was at the end of last year. Then at the beginning of this year, I finalized exactly what I wanted to research, finding something that no one has investigated before. While I saw that individuals such as a researcher from Stanford had studied the tutors' perspective on AI-assisted tutoring, there was minimal insight from tutees.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1604 0 R
>>
endobj
